rary paths. CMsiConfigurationManager::MsiBeginTransactionW() The CMsiConfigurationManager::MsiBeginTransactionW() method is the COM interface method at vtable offset 0xA0 : __int64 __fastcall CMsiConfigurationManager::MsiBeginTransactionW(
